  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I’m in the camp that you should have pushed the update back till all the features were implemented but since you decided to double down anyway, here are just a few things I’d love to see.\nBetter portal placement: have the portal drop wherever you point\nAvatar limbs grabber: this was really fun and I want to be able to be picked up in any world or posed.\nAvatar scaling: please, add proper avatar scaling.\nFlying/nocloping: neos and chillout do it, it’s incredibly useful. Add an option for game world creators to toggle it off.\nTeleport to friends: make people be able to opt into it, disable in game worlds\nAvatar searching: complicated but necessary.\nSeats mod: not holding my breath for this one but the option to parent yourself to people that allow it, being able to sit on someone’s head or shoulder is very charming \nCamera animations/ high resolution photos: option to take photos up to 16k, add camera animations for creators, have a auto orbit and a drone mode like chillout has.\nProplates: get pronouns from people’s bios and display them under their nameplate\nDrop portal to friends: be able to drop portals to friends worlds.\nScreenshot manager: be able to browse your vrchat pictures in game\nLoading screen images: be able to have pictures in the loading screen instead of tips.\nToo much to hope for from the devs but official workshop support and not have this be an issue in the first place?",
